	(text "HC32L110C6UA QFN-20 (CSP-16 rejected: inner balls not routable with JLC rules). v2 pinout kept: SDA P35, SCL P36, STOP_IN P31 (=SWCLK), STOP_OUT P02, LED P01. Freed ADD pins: P34/P33 = private I2C to the GreenPAK, P03/P15/P14/P32 = AUX4..7 (node-local), P23 user button."
